# Integration tests for the Postgres adapter.
# Placed here so the CI workflow's --run target resolves even when the
# directory is empty. Real tests land in a follow-up:
#
#   - schema DDL applies without error
#   - withBookClient isolates search_path (two books can't see each other)
#   - rewritePlaceholders output runs cleanly against live Postgres
#   - import → query round-trip
#   - dialect golden tests: identical results vs SQLite on shared fixtures
